{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>CyanSparrow 是一款專注於隱私保護的投資追蹤與回報分析應用程式，適合希望完全掌控數據並避免雲端同步的個人投資者。該 App 現正限時免費下載，讓用戶能無需訂閱費用即可享受完整功能，輕鬆管理本地投資紀錄。</p>\n\n<h2>全離線安全數據管理</h2>\n<p>這款應用主打完全離線運作，所有帳戶資訊、投資紀錄及偏好設定均僅儲存於本機裝置，絕不上傳伺服器或分享予第三方。它支援多用戶切換、自動計算個別及年化回報率，並提供月度與年度績效統計檢視。介面涵蓋淺色、深色及系統模式，支援美元與人民幣顯示，同時利用 iOS Keychain 強化本地密碼保護，確保個人財務數據的高度安全性與私密性。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-8-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-9-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CyanSparrow: Profit Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T04:04:57.516132+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}